  "body": "## Summary\n- Adds independent SCAN v0.26 and its frozen release evidence under Anchor only.\n- Corrects the generic human-surface denominator: preserves 330 declared/factory surfaces, 147 QActions, and four real CLI options while removing 108 false reference candidates.\n- Synchronizes v0.32 canonical Anchor documents; Hermes remains an opt-in example and MantleOS product paths are unchanged.\n\n## Evidence\n- 144 passed; 3 expected Windows symlink-privilege skips.\n- Two exact NotepadNext cold scans: all 21 outputs byte-identical; all canonical database rows identical.\n- Warm cache: 4,186 hits, 0 misses; no canonical/workbench drift.\n- Fresh Python 3.13.13 installed-wheel certification and independent verification: 12/12 files PASS, zero issues.\n\nPR5 remains calibration PARTIAL: 380 surfaces (310 bound, 59 partial, 11 unresolved). H-001 remains frozen and source-uninspected.",
